{"id":"70a2c973530fdb63c90d0a28f16572adcf3e8860","url":"https://www.leiphone.com/category/yanxishe/e05vwo1DgZf3HnFZ.html","title":"数学大佬在前面拓荒，AI研究员在后面捡宝，菲尔兹奖还能拿来破AI「黑盒」？ | 雷峰网","site_name":"TopHub","source":"Readhub · AI","byline":null,"excerpt":"数学界与AI界狠狠联动了","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div>\n                                                <!-- 123 -->\n                        \n                        \n                                                \n                        <!-- AI影响因子 -->\n                        <!-- xhBPeYDbNuuRZkwy -->\n                                                <!-- AI影响因子 -->\n                        <!-- 正文内容 -->\n                        <section data-mpa-action-id=\"mmiwq6ij1i3r\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img alt=\"数学大佬在前面拓荒，AI研究员在后面捡宝，菲尔兹奖还能拿来破AI「黑盒」？\" data-src=\"https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20260726/6a65cae5a33d9.png\" data-ratio=\"0.55\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1000\" data-croporisrc=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/XqAicMdcoiafN2MVwdFsq226t22NrxZ7FVoR1weZ0ickEgOYTpkVTriaIS7vbJPr9K3sB0Sua7Vy9HasJzlJIvuz23hjY208d8ndQHSgR8NhhSk/0?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg\" data-cropselx1=\"0\" data-cropselx2=\"546\" data-cropsely1=\"0\" data-cropsely2=\"307\" data-imgfileid=\"100256476\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20260726/6a65cae5a33d9.png?imageMogr2/quality/90\"></section><section data-pm-slice=\"5 10 []\" data-mpa-action-id=\"mmix4tgk1t7p\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-data-temp-type=\"image\" mpa-data-temp-power-by=\"yiban.io\" data-mpa-template=\"t\" data-mid=\"\"><section><section><span><span data-mpa-action-id=\"mmix6wyl1l05\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">数学界与AI界狠狠联动了</span></span></span></span></section><span data-mpa-action-id=\"mqgbkegzw9n\"></span><span data-mpa-action-id=\"mpmlbwxl8oz\"></span><span data-lark-record-data=\"{&quot;rootId&quot;:&quot;FdZeduLh9ohPKcxr1VDcCN8nnRh&q